1. Jalankan MediaMTX
https://github.com/bluenviron/mediamtx/releases?utm_source=chatgpt.com#release-v1.20.1
Jalankan:

mediamtx.exe

Yang kita pakai:

RTMP IN       :1935
WebRTC HTTP   :8889
WebRTC ICE    :8189

Flow-nya:

SOURCE
   ↓
 RTMP
   ↓
MediaMTX :1935
   ↓
 WebRTC
   ↓
HTML / Browser :8889
2. MP4 → RTMP AUX1

Contoh file:

D:\video\ORI.mp4

Command:

ffmpeg -re -stream_loop -1 -i "D:\video\ORI.mp4" -c:v libx264 -preset ultrafast -tune zerolatency -an -f flv rtmp://127.0.0.1:1935/aux1

Hasil:

ORI.mp4 → RTMP → aux1

Preview:

AUX 1 WebRTC Preview

3. MP4 kedua → AUX2/AUX3

Tinggal beda nama path:

ffmpeg -re -stream_loop -1 -i "D:\video\VIDEO2.mp4" -c:v libx264 -preset ultrafast -tune zerolatency -an -f flv rtmp://127.0.0.1:1935/aux2

Atau:

ffmpeg -re -stream_loop -1 -i "D:\video\VIDEO3.mp4" -c:v libx264 -preset ultrafast -tune zerolatency -an -f flv rtmp://127.0.0.1:1935/aux3



4. Webcam → RTMP

Cari dulu nama webcam:

ffmpeg -list_devices true -f dshow -i dummy

Di laptop lo ketemu:

Integrated Camera

Kirim webcam misalnya ke AUX2:

ffmpeg -f dshow -i video="Integrated Camera" -c:v libx264 -preset ultrafast -tune zerolatency -an -f flv rtmp://127.0.0.1:1935/aux2

Jadi bisa:

ORI.mp4            → aux1
Integrated Camera  → aux2
Video lain         → aux3
